commit 88bc8c137e2d1714d98a3157c7c6f33bf9f12388
Author: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 3 15:16:26 2026 +0000

    fix(cabinet): fresh identity via per-page CabinetShell wrapper
    
    Next 15 does not re-run route-group template on sibling soft nav, so each
    page again wraps content in a thin CabinetShell that computes the token and
    reconciles against the persistent layout shell.
    
    Co-authored-by: Аведикян Карен <karenavedikyan@users.noreply.github.com>

